{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>無綫台慶劇《璀璨之城》今晚（15日）播出的一集迎來全劇高潮！由陳瀅飾演的記者霍佩樺（Sarah），為了與官孝賢（張智霖飾）達成合作，之後上演一場極限挑戰，當眾解開襯衫並脫下外衣和牛仔褲，最後只穿黑色喱士內衣褲對鏡頭，最後更大膽全裸展現完美身段。</p><figure><img alt=\"陳瀅寬衣解帶。（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524344595877888695314.jpeg/EQ008HyLLeYxNwDtOrn-A3fwtu_GjKZZzavxds2r8XY\"/><figcaption>陳瀅寬衣解帶。（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"陳瀅寬衣解帶。（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524339977687040015846.jpeg/eI3jWR3a7y119wz7Hqc8bpyMcESV_EjPvE6wtbxOsLU\"/><figcaption>陳瀅寬衣解帶。（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"褪去衣衫。（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524342234353664194273.jpeg/mHwRUKL4qPl181KHQ3exJx5IIjiejphnzx84Sc8fOEk\"/><figcaption>褪去衣衫。（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"褲都除埋。（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524349365063680059832.jpeg/coM-mfdMowyRYBr3Tdqal-3Vw4p58KISFmYobhZmKG4\"/><figcaption>褲都除埋。（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"褲都除埋。（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524339780554752895604.jpeg/NeisbD5cFVFP443rjh7arQisGkkiKyj79R0xlPUdMZQ\"/><figcaption>褲都除埋。（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"以為完？仲有！（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524347204866048956012.jpeg/DoduTd5KqtdkJ_ILde9v-deV7mR-DaZNbgFJqG4BSag\"/><figcaption>以為完？仲有！（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"以為完？仲有！（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524342263713792694132.jpeg/Otu4QKny-Hwbl7UkUomt5nqxw79rSe7hcx1oBHMdaAQ\"/><figcaption>以為完？仲有！（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"唔止呀！仲有！（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524344579100672953086.jpeg/CT-n7QyrtMhZ6MtRAZgeqka40_43vCo6WHL53lhy-d4\"/><figcaption>唔止呀！仲有！（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>張智霖在劇中一臉嚴肅，默默看着陳瀅這一幕大膽舉動，兩人的對手戲火花四濺，張力十足！陳瀅在接受《香港01》訪問時，指與張智霖會有不少「精彩」場口，至於尺度會否超越對方與陳曉華的對手戲，留待觀眾評斷。她更透露為了這套劇特別去操弗，希望能突顯身材線條。</p><figure><img alt=\"不得不讚陳瀅身形好好。（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524879654850560793146.jpeg/A38kDn0Bcf_3grwdJReKqx1C3XO7Ido87lhy4-5YcuM\"/><figcaption>不得不讚陳瀅身形好好。（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"不得不讚陳瀅身形好好。（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524877431738368039651.jpeg/uAk78lig0Q6Tfn5mjsCz7-Xz9KtKpbiKCPecTAj3nEw\"/><figcaption>不得不讚陳瀅身形好好。（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"仲有得繼續除。（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524875191848960913246.jpeg/l06P-kj_xf90arL-vOw3-rzy5HM-UaUehIWf7ISFn-w\"/><figcaption>仲有得繼續除。（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"底褲都除埋。（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524884730220544671890.jpeg/7MnsqBxr_uhMSjPO6eYPUHyGVIu81mkP4TJSF-EyUhc\"/><figcaption>底褲都除埋。（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"底褲都除埋。（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524882259644416014268.jpeg/85jlXR2rw5SXmjXSfikxwXqyg2fjQvBYk_BpsZPwabE\"/><figcaption>底褲都除埋。（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"bra都除埋。（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524879885537280845179.jpeg/2anTvNkKKueq5Ppc2UxrMz0eVtvW-6C8kPEnwpDxJ8I\"/><figcaption>bra都除埋。（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"bra都除埋。（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524877704368128078512.jpeg/ZOYH-2k86p526WDC4IgFkSUOx-GFZAsL_LHGp_yxxqc\"/><figcaption>bra都除埋。（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"被張智霖打開雙腿。（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187524875351232512280451.jpeg/Rq5ATUGnEWBi1NHw4niIc0UAHNKY8eT13y0rZt8tK2Y\"/><figcaption>被張智霖打開雙腿。（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"被張智霖打開雙腿。（劇集截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261015/1187526157763874816195872.jpeg/4Bj48KHF3In659UElvX6BLaMe6wsA3sNL5-7dC-fu3Q\"/><figcaption>被張智霖打開雙腿。（劇集截圖）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T02:02:50.159050+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":488,"images":17,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T14:04:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T08:58:22.585623+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T01:59:18.943136+00:00","content_hash":"8d946d19f17498ccab19a64c21da46a2a3102537a5f4aba950f19e0609d1f9d2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}